# ============================================================
# Full-resolution image originals (~190 MB)
# ============================================================
# assets/ is a local mirror of the "Firm Foundation images" Supabase
# bucket. The site never serves these directly - it serves the
# generated 800x800 thumbnails from assets/thumbs/ instead.
# Ignore the originals so nobody accidentally commits 190 MB.
#
# Note: use "assets/*" (not "assets/") so git still descends into
# the folder and the !assets/thumbs/ rule below can re-include it.

assets/*
!assets/thumbs/
!assets/thumbs/**

# Founder photos ARE served directly by about.html - keep these two.
!assets/founder1.jpg
!assets/founder2.jpg

# Gallery thumbnails (7.35 MB) ARE committed on purpose.
# Each <img> in gallery.html points at the Supabase thumb URL and falls
# back to the local copy via onerror, so the gallery renders even before
# the thumbs/ prefix has been uploaded to the bucket.
# Regenerate + re-upload with gen.bat if the photos ever change.

thumbs-upload/

# ============================================================
# Local tooling
# ============================================================
# One-off image optimisation helpers. Kept out of the repo; none of
# them are needed to serve the site.
fix_gallery.ps1
gen.bat
gen_thumbs.ps1
gen_thumbs2.ps1
fetch_missing.ps1

# ============================================================
# OS / editor noise
# ============================================================
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.lnk
.vscode/
.idea/
